# OpenClaw Workspace Files

## Bootstrap Files (injected into agent context every session)
| File | Purpose | Load condition |
|------|---------|----------------|
| `AGENTS.md` | Operating instructions, memory workflow, red lines | Always |
| `SOUL.md` | Persona, tone, voice, opinions | Always |
| `USER.md` | Who the user is, how to address them | Always |
| `IDENTITY.md` | Agent name, vibe, emoji | Always |
| `TOOLS.md` | Local tool notes and conventions (guidance only — doesn't control tool availability) | Always |
| `HEARTBEAT.md` | Short checklist for heartbeat runs — keep tiny to avoid token burn | Heartbeat runs |
| `BOOT.md` | Startup checklist on gateway restart (uses message tool for outbound) | Gateway restart |
| `BOOTSTRAP.md` | One-time first-run ritual — DELETE after completing | First run only |
| `memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md` | Daily session notes — today + yesterday | Manual (agent reads) |
| `MEMORY.md` | Curated long-term memory — ONLY load in main/private session | Main session only |

## Sub-Agent Context Limitation
Sub-agents spawned via `sessions_spawn` only inject **AGENTS.md + TOOLS.md**.
They do NOT get SOUL.md, IDENTITY.md, USER.md, HEARTBEAT.md, or BOOTSTRAP.md.

## Required Files Per Agent Workspace
Every `workspace-{agent}/` must have:
- `AGENTS.md` — role, workflow, red lines
- `SOUL.md` — persona and tone
- `IDENTITY.md` — name/emoji
- `USER.md` — client/upstream agent context
- `TOOLS.md` — tool conventions
- `memory/` — daily log directory

## File Size Limits
- Large bootstrap files are truncated at injection (default 20,000 chars per file)
- Total bootstrap budget: 150,000 chars across all files
- Keep HEARTBEAT.md and BOOT.md short — token cost is real

## Skills Location (highest precedence first)
1. `workspace-{agent}/skills/` — workspace-specific, highest priority
2. `/.agents/skills/` — project agent skills
3. `~/.agents/skills/` — personal agent skills
4. `~/.openclaw/skills/` — managed/shared across all agents
5. Bundled skills (shipped with install)
6. `skills.load.extraDirs` — lowest priority

## Session Storage
Sessions stored at: `~/.openclaw/agents/{agentId}/sessions/{sessionId}.jsonl`
Auth profiles at: `~/.openclaw/agents/{agentId}/agent/auth-profiles.json`
These are NOT in the workspace — never commit them.
